{"seq":1,"slug":"bottleneck-identification","title":"瓶颈识别方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/analysis/bottleneck-identification","wordCount":1182,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"瓶颈识别方法\">瓶颈识别方法</h1><p>性能测试数据告诉你「有问题」，但不告诉你「问题在哪」。瓶颈识别是连接症状与根因的桥梁。本篇介绍两套系统化方法论：USE 方法和 TSA 方法，以及排队论的直觉性理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>术语</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>USE 方法</td>\n<td>Utilization/Saturation/Errors，对每个资源回答三个问题的分析框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利用率（Utilization）</td>\n<td>资源正在使用的时间比例（0%-100%）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和度（Saturation）</td>\n<td>资源有工作要做但无法立即处理（排队等待）的程度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TSA 方法</td>\n<td>Thread State Analysis，针对 JVM 应用的线程状态分析方法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>断裂点</td>\n<td>系统出现明显性能降级或错误的负载临界点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排队论</td>\n<td>描述等待队列行为的数学理论，帮助理解高负载下延迟急剧增加的原因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Little&#39;s Law</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span>，系统中平均请求数 = 到达率 × 平均停留时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"use-方法\">USE 方法</h2><p>Brendan Gregg 提出的 USE（Utilization/Saturation/Errors）方法是资源分析的标准框架。对每一个系统资源，都回答三个问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Utilization（利用率）</strong>：资源正在使用的时间比例（0%-100%）</li>\n<li><strong>Saturation（饱和度）</strong>：资源有额外工作要做但无法立即处理（排队）</li>\n<li><strong>Errors（错误数）</strong>：资源报告的错误事件数</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    USE[USE 检查清单] --&gt; CPU[CPU]&#10;    USE --&gt; Memory[内存]&#10;    USE --&gt; Network[网络接口]&#10;    USE --&gt; Storage[存储设备]&#10;    USE --&gt; Bus[总线/带宽]&#10;&#10;    CPU --&gt; CPU_U[利用率: mpstat, top]&#10;    CPU --&gt; CPU_S[饱和度: vmstat r 队列]&#10;    CPU --&gt; CPU_E[错误: 机器检查异常]&#10;&#10;    Memory --&gt; Mem_U[利用率: free, /proc/meminfo]&#10;    Memory --&gt; Mem_S[饱和度: vmstat si/so swap]&#10;    Memory --&gt; Mem_E[错误: ECC 内存错误]&#10;&#10;    Network --&gt; Net_U[利用率: nicstat, sar -n DEV]&#10;    Network --&gt; Net_S[饱和度: ifconfig overruns]&#10;    Network --&gt; Net_E[错误: netstat -s 错误计数]\">graph TD\n    USE[USE 检查清单] --&gt; CPU[CPU]\n    USE --&gt; Memory[内存]\n    USE --&gt; Network[网络接口]\n    USE --&gt; Storage[存储设备]\n    USE --&gt; Bus[总线/带宽]\n\n    CPU --&gt; CPU_U[利用率: mpstat, top]\n    CPU --&gt; CPU_S[饱和度: vmstat r 队列]\n    CPU --&gt; CPU_E[错误: 机器检查异常]\n\n    Memory --&gt; Mem_U[利用率: free, /proc/meminfo]\n    Memory --&gt; Mem_S[饱和度: vmstat si/so swap]\n    Memory --&gt; Mem_E[错误: ECC 内存错误]\n\n    Network --&gt; Net_U[利用率: nicstat, sar -n DEV]\n    Network --&gt; Net_S[饱和度: ifconfig overruns]\n    Network --&gt; Net_E[错误: netstat -s 错误计数]</pre><h3 id=\"cpu-分析\">CPU 分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. CPU 利用率（整体）&#10;mpstat 1 10&#10;# %user %system %iowait %idle&#10;# 重点看 %iowait（I/O 等待）和 %idle&#10;&#10;# 2. 每核 CPU 利用率&#10;mpstat -P ALL 1 5&#10;# 发现某核 100%，其余低 → 单线程瓶颈，程序未充分利用多核&#10;&#10;# 3. CPU 运行队列（饱和度）&#10;vmstat 1 10&#10;# r 列：等待 CPU 的进程数&#10;# r &gt; CPU 核数 × 2 → CPU 饱和&#10;&#10;# 4. CPU 等待细分&#10;pidstat -u 1 10&#10;# 找出 CPU 占用最高的进程/线程\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. CPU 利用率（整体）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mpstat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># %user %system %iowait %idle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 重点看 %iowait（I/O 等待）和 %idle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 每核 CPU 利用率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mpstat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -P</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ALL</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 发现某核 100%，其余低 → 单线程瓶颈，程序未充分利用多核</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. CPU 运行队列（饱和度）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vmstat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># r 列：等待 CPU 的进程数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># r > CPU 核数 × 2 → CPU 饱和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. CPU 等待细分</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pidstat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 找出 CPU 占用最高的进程/线程</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>CPU 指标</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>利用率</td>\n<td>&gt; 70%</td>\n<td>开始警惕</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>利用率</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n<td>接近饱和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行队列</td>\n<td>&gt; 核数 × 2</td>\n<td>CPU 饱和，延迟上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>iowait</td>\n<td>&gt; 20%</td>\n<td>磁盘或网络 I/O 成为瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"内存分析\">内存分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 内存使用概览&#10;free -m&#10;# 重点关注 available（可用内存）而非 free&#10;&#10;# 2. 内存饱和度（swap 活动）&#10;vmstat 1 10&#10;# si（swap in）和 so（swap out）不为 0 → 内存压力&#10;&#10;# 3. 内存详情&#10;cat /proc/meminfo | grep -E &quot;MemTotal|MemFree|MemAvailable|Cached|Buffers|SwapUsed&quot;&#10;&#10;# 4. 进程内存占用&#10;ps aux --sort=-%mem | head -10\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 内存使用概览</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">free</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 重点关注 available（可用内存）而非 free</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 内存饱和度（swap 活动）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vmstat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># si（swap in）和 so（swap out）不为 0 → 内存压力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 内存详情</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /proc/meminfo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"MemTotal|MemFree|MemAvailable|Cached|Buffers|SwapUsed\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 4. 进程内存占用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ps</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> aux</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --sort=-%mem</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> head</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -10</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>内存泄漏检测</strong>（浸泡测试期间）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 每 60 秒记录一次 JVM 堆内存&#10;while true; do&#10;  timestamp=$(date +%s)&#10;  heap_used=$(curl -s http://app:8080/metrics | grep &#39;jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=&quot;heap&quot;}&#39; | awk &#39;{print $2}&#39;)&#10;  echo &quot;$timestamp,$heap_used&quot; &gt;&gt; heap_trend.csv&#10;  sleep 60&#10;done\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 每 60 秒记录一次 JVM 堆内存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">date</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> +%s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  heap_used</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> http://app:8080/metrics</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'jvm_memory_used_bytes{area=\"heap\"}'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $2}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">,</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$heap_used</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> heap_trend.csv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  sleep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">done</span></span></code></pre></div><p>如果 <code>heap_used</code> 持续上升，即使 GC 后也不回落，说明存在内存泄漏。</p>\n<h3 id=\"磁盘-i-o-分析\">磁盘 I/O 分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. I/O 统计（每秒）&#10;iostat -x 1 10&#10;# 关键指标：&#10;#   %util：磁盘利用率&#10;#   await：I/O 平均等待时间（ms）&#10;#   r/s w/s：读写请求数/秒&#10;#   rkB/s wkB/s：读写吞吐量&#10;&#10;# 2. 具体进程的 I/O&#10;iotop -oP&#10;# 找出 I/O 最密集的进程&#10;&#10;# 3. 磁盘队列深度&#10;cat /sys/block/sda/queue/nr_requests\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. I/O 统计（每秒）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iostat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关键指标：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   %util：磁盘利用率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   await：I/O 平均等待时间（ms）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   r/s w/s：读写请求数/秒</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   rkB/s wkB/s：读写吞吐量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 具体进程的 I/O</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">iotop</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -oP</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 找出 I/O 最密集的进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 磁盘队列深度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /sys/block/sda/queue/nr_requests</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>磁盘指标</th>\n<th>告警阈值</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>%util</td>\n<td>&gt; 80%</td>\n<td>磁盘接近饱和</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>await（HDD）</td>\n<td>&gt; 20ms</td>\n<td>等待时间过长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>await（SSD）</td>\n<td>&gt; 2ms</td>\n<td>SSD 异常，可能过热或硬件问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"网络分析\">网络分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 1. 网络接口统计&#10;sar -n DEV 1 10&#10;# rxkB/s txkB/s：接收/发送吞吐量（与网卡带宽对比）&#10;# rxpck/s txpck/s：每秒包数&#10;&#10;# 2. TCP 状态统计&#10;ss -s&#10;# 关注 TIME-WAIT 数量（大量 TIME-WAIT 可能是连接复用问题）&#10;# CLOSE-WAIT 数量（大量 CLOSE-WAIT 是服务端未关闭连接的 bug）&#10;&#10;# 3. 网络错误&#10;netstat -s | grep -E &quot;errors|retransmit|dropped&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 网络接口统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> DEV</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># rxkB/s txkB/s：接收/发送吞吐量（与网卡带宽对比）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># rxpck/s txpck/s：每秒包数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. TCP 状态统计</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ss</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关注 TIME-WAIT 数量（大量 TIME-WAIT 可能是连接复用问题）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># CLOSE-WAIT 数量（大量 CLOSE-WAIT 是服务端未关闭连接的 bug）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 网络错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">netstat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -E</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"errors|retransmit|dropped\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"tsa-方法-线程状态分析\">TSA 方法（线程状态分析）</h2><p>对于 JVM 应用，Thread State Analysis 是定位 Java 服务瓶颈的专用方法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"线程状态分类\">线程状态分类</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>高比例意味着</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RUNNABLE</td>\n<td>正在执行</td>\n<td>CPU 密集型瓶颈</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BLOCKED</td>\n<td>等待 synchronized 锁</td>\n<td>锁竞争严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WAITING</td>\n<td>等待 notify（如线程池队列满）</td>\n<td>生产者消费者不平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TIMED_WAITING</td>\n<td>超时等待（如 sleep、join）</td>\n<td>通常是 I/O 等待</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"线程-dump-分析\">线程 Dump 分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 获取线程 dump&#10;kill -3 &lt;java-pid&gt;          # 输出到 stdout&#10;jstack &lt;java-pid&gt;           # jstack 工具&#10;jcmd &lt;java-pid&gt; Thread.print # jcmd 命令&#10;&#10;# 快速统计线程状态分布&#10;jstack &lt;pid&gt; | grep &quot;java.lang.Thread.State&quot; | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 获取线程 dump</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kill</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">java-pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 输出到 stdout</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jstack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">java-pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           # jstack 工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jcmd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">java-pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Thread.print</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # jcmd 命令</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 快速统计线程状态分布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">jstack</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pi</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> grep</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"java.lang.Thread.State\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uniq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rn</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型的瓶颈模式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 锁竞争：大量线程 BLOCKED 在同一个锁上&#10;&quot;http-nio-8080-exec-47&quot; BLOCKED on java.util.HashMap@6f7fd0e6&#10;&quot;http-nio-8080-exec-23&quot; BLOCKED on java.util.HashMap@6f7fd0e6&#10;↑ HashMap 被多线程访问，应换成 ConcurrentHashMap&#10;&#10;# 连接池耗尽：线程在等待连接&#10;&quot;http-nio-8080-exec-15&quot; WAITING at com.zaxxer.hikari.HikariDataSource.getConnection&#10;↑ 数据库连接池设置太小，或查询耗时太长\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 锁竞争：大量线程 BLOCKED 在同一个锁上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"http-nio-8080-exec-47\" BLOCKED on java.util.HashMap@6f7fd0e6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"http-nio-8080-exec-23\" BLOCKED on java.util.HashMap@6f7fd0e6</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↑ HashMap 被多线程访问，应换成 ConcurrentHashMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 连接池耗尽：线程在等待连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>\"http-nio-8080-exec-15\" WAITING at com.zaxxer.hikari.HikariDataSource.getConnection</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>↑ 数据库连接池设置太小，或查询耗时太长</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"排队论直觉\">排队论直觉</h2><p>理解排队论不需要数学推导，只需要建立直觉。</p>\n<h3 id=\"利特尔定律-little-s-law\">利特尔定律（Little&#39;s Law）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = \\lambda W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">λW</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>：系统中的平均请求数（进行中 + 排队中）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>：请求到达率（RPS）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>：每个请求的平均停留时间（响应时间）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>实际应用</strong>：</p>\n<p>已知 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mtext> RPS</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda = 500 \\text{ RPS}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> RPS</span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mtext> ms</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mtext> s</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W = 200 \\text{ ms} = 0.2 \\text{ s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> ms</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> s</span></span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>500</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext> 个并发请求</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 500 \\times 0.2 = 100 \\text{ 个并发请求}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">个并发请求</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>所以需要 100 个并发 VU 才能达到 500 RPS 的稳态。</p>\n<h3 id=\"服务时间-vs-响应时间\">服务时间 vs 响应时间</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"响应时间 = 排队时间 + 服务时间\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>响应时间 = 排队时间 + 服务时间</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当系统利用率接近 100% 时，排队时间急剧增加：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>利用率</th>\n<th>平均排队时间（M/M/1 模型）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>50%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>服务时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 1 \\times \\text{服务时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">服务时间</span></span></span></span></span></span>（等于服务时间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>80%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>服务时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 4 \\times \\text{服务时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">服务时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>90%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>服务时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 9 \\times \\text{服务时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">服务时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>95%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>服务时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 19 \\times \\text{服务时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">19</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">服务时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>99%</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>99</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>服务时间</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 99 \\times \\text{服务时间}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">服务时间</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这就是为什么 CPU 从 90% 提升到 95% 会导致响应时间翻倍——不是线性关系，而是<strong>指数级劣化</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"容量拐点\">容量拐点</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    X[负载/RPS] --&gt; Y[响应时间/ms]\">graph LR\n    X[负载/RPS] --&gt; Y[响应时间/ms]</pre><p>在实际测试中，响应时间曲线通常呈&quot;曲棍球棒&quot;形状：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"延迟(ms)&#10;  |                          /&#10;  |                         /&#10;500|                        /&#10;  |                      /&#10;200|─────────────────────&#10;  |&#10;  +──────────────────────────── RPS&#10;               ↑&#10;            拐点（系统开始饱和）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>延迟(ms)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  |                          /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  |                         /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>500|                        /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  |                      /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>200|─────────────────────</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  +──────────────────────────── RPS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>               ↑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            拐点（系统开始饱和）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>找到拐点是压力测试的核心目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"系统化瓶颈分析流程\">系统化瓶颈分析流程</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[性能测试结果异常] --&gt; B{错误率高?}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C[检查应用日志&lt;br/&gt;找 5xx/超时错误]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; D{延迟高?}&#10;    D -- 是 --&gt; E[USE 方法&lt;br/&gt;检查资源利用率]&#10;    D -- 否 --&gt; F[检查吞吐量&lt;br/&gt;是否达到预期]&#10;    E --&gt; G{哪个资源饱和?}&#10;    G -- CPU --&gt; H[分析热点代码&lt;br/&gt;见 3.2 Profiling]&#10;    G -- 内存 --&gt; I[分析内存分配&lt;br/&gt;GC 日志]&#10;    G -- 磁盘 --&gt; J[分析 SQL 查询&lt;br/&gt;数据库慢查询]&#10;    G -- 网络 --&gt; K[检查连接数&lt;br/&gt;带宽利用率]&#10;    G -- 都不饱和 --&gt; L[TSA 线程状态分析&lt;br/&gt;找锁竞争]\">graph TD\n    A[性能测试结果异常] --&gt; B{错误率高?}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C[检查应用日志&lt;br/&gt;找 5xx/超时错误]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; D{延迟高?}\n    D -- 是 --&gt; E[USE 方法&lt;br/&gt;检查资源利用率]\n    D -- 否 --&gt; F[检查吞吐量&lt;br/&gt;是否达到预期]\n    E --&gt; G{哪个资源饱和?}\n    G -- CPU --&gt; H[分析热点代码&lt;br/&gt;见 3.2 Profiling]\n    G -- 内存 --&gt; I[分析内存分配&lt;br/&gt;GC 日志]\n    G -- 磁盘 --&gt; J[分析 SQL 查询&lt;br/&gt;数据库慢查询]\n    G -- 网络 --&gt; K[检查连接数&lt;br/&gt;带宽利用率]\n    G -- 都不饱和 --&gt; L[TSA 线程状态分析&lt;br/&gt;找锁竞争]</pre><h2 id=\"常见瓶颈模式速查\">常见瓶颈模式速查</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>症状</th>\n<th>可能瓶颈</th>\n<th>快速验证</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>延迟高但 CPU 低</td>\n<td>数据库/外部 API 慢</td>\n<td>检查慢查询日志、外部调用耗时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CPU 100%，单核</td>\n<td>单线程瓶颈</td>\n<td>检查 jstack，找 RUNNABLE 热点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大量 CLOSE-WAIT</td>\n<td>连接泄漏</td>\n<td><code>ss -s</code> 查看 TCP 状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存持续增长</td>\n<td>内存泄漏</td>\n<td>GC 日志 + heap dump 分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>周期性延迟抖动</td>\n<td>GC 停顿</td>\n<td>开启 GC 日志，查看 STW 时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接拒绝</td>\n<td>连接池耗尽</td>\n<td>查看数据库连接数 vs 连接池大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘 await 高</td>\n<td>I/O 瓶颈</td>\n<td><code>iostat -x</code> 检查队列深度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>瓶颈识别需要方法论，而不是随机猜测。USE 方法提供了系统化的资源分析框架——对每个资源（CPU、内存、磁盘、网络）依次检查利用率、饱和度和错误；TSA 方法专攻 JVM 的线程状态，能快速定位锁竞争和连接池耗尽。排队论则提供了直觉：利用率超过 80% 时，延迟增长不是线性的，而是指数级劣化。掌握这三个工具，可以将「性能下降」的症状快速转化为可修复的根因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"兄弟文档导航\">兄弟文档导航</h2>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"瓶颈识别方法","id":"瓶颈识别方法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"USE 方法","id":"use-方法"},{"level":3,"text":"CPU 分析","id":"cpu-分析"},{"level":3,"text":"内存分析","id":"内存分析"},{"level":3,"text":"磁盘 I/O 分析","id":"磁盘-i-o-分析"},{"level":3,"text":"网络分析","id":"网络分析"},{"level":2,"text":"TSA 方法（线程状态分析）","id":"tsa-方法-线程状态分析"},{"level":3,"text":"线程状态分类","id":"线程状态分类"},{"level":3,"text":"线程 Dump 分析","id":"线程-dump-分析"},{"level":2,"text":"排队论直觉","id":"排队论直觉"},{"level":3,"text":"利特尔定律（Little's Law）","id":"利特尔定律-little-s-law"},{"level":3,"text":"服务时间 vs 响应时间","id":"服务时间-vs-响应时间"},{"level":3,"text":"容量拐点","id":"容量拐点"},{"level":2,"text":"系统化瓶颈分析流程","id":"系统化瓶颈分析流程"},{"level":2,"text":"常见瓶颈模式速查","id":"常见瓶颈模式速查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"兄弟文档导航","id":"兄弟文档导航"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式执行与编排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/toolchain/distributed-execution"},"next":{"title":"Profiling 与 Tracing","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/load-testing-performance/analysis/profiling-tracing"}}